  "description": "PC-QD-NEVPT2 on the same cases, orbitals and transition RDMs: per class <I|V|Psi_J^(1)> = -sum_t b_{I<-J,t}^T (K_J + Delta_t S_J)^+ b_{J,t}, nevpt2::pc_class_energies' S, K, S1, cut and gap rule; the arrays are <case>/pc_*.npy, qd_nevpt2/README.md has the conventions. A refused case (a class of a root under the gap rule) has no pc_ arrays and no PC H_eff; its ungated_diagnostic is NOT a test target",
